            },
            "body": "<!-- devin-review-comment {\"id\": \"BUG_pr-review-job-e7ae217d7572485fbdfca2e3a2fd1039_0001\", \"file_path\": \".github/workflows/perf.yml\", \"start_line\": 12, \"end_line\": 12, \"side\": \"RIGHT\", \"based_on_repo_rules\": false, \"kind\": \"bug\"} -->\n\n🔴 **Calibration label removal leaves gate bypassed**\n\nAfter `perf-aa` is removed from a simulation PR, `host` retains its successful main-versus-main result. No `unlabeled` run replaces it, so the PR's host regression remains untested.\n\n```suggestion\n    types: [opened, synchronize, reopened, labeled, unlabeled]\n```\n\n<!-- devin-review-badge-begin -->\n<a href=\"https://app.devin.ai/review/rayfernando1337/kongroyale/pull/285\" target=\"_blank\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://static.devin.ai/assets/gh-devin-review-dark.svg?v=4\"><img src=\"https://static.devin.ai/assets/gh-devin-review-light.svg?v=4\" alt=\"Devin Review\"></picture></a>\n<!-- devin-review-badge-end -->\n\n---\n*Was this helpful? React with 👍 or 👎 to provide feedback.*",
